#. ja: 巨大偏属性クリスタル破壊指令
#. de: Befehl: Korrumpierte Riesenkristalle zersplittern
#. fr: Destruction : la corruption, c'est pas bon
#. column 2: A mass of enormous corrupted crystals has been detected near the Scream Puff. Pilot a vacuum suit, destroy the crystals, and gather the remnants for processing and repurposing.
#. column 3: Destroy large corrupted crystals.
#. column 6: Destroy small corrupted crystals and submit the remnants to the field scanners.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Destroy Corrupted Crystals” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:1:0:1"
msgid "Directive: Destroy Corrupted Crystals"
msgstr "Приказ: разрушить искажённые кристаллы"

#. ja: スクリーム・パフ付近で、セントラルクリスタルによる月面の環境制御から溢れた巨大偏属性クリスタルの大量発生が確認された。パワーローダーで現地に赴き、巨大偏属性クリスタルを粉砕し、属性変換用の資源として回収してもらいたい。
#. de: Ein temporärer Fehler in der Ökokontrolle des Zentralkristalls hat zu Riesenkristallaufkommen in der Nähe der Schreienden Krümel geführt. Erkorene Projektmitglieder haben sich um die rasche Zersplitterung der Kristalle und das Auflesen als Rohstoff zu kümmern.
#. fr: La régulation générée par le cristal central a fait apparaître une grande quantité de cristaux corrompus près de La Pâte brisée. Pilotez un mécano cosmique pour les détruire puis récupérez leurs restes, qui seront utilisés comme matériaux de conversion éthéréenne.
#. column 1: Directive: Destroy Corrupted Crystals
#. column 3: Destroy large corrupted crystals.
#. column 6: Destroy small corrupted crystals and submit the remnants to the field scanners.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Destroy Corrupted Crystals” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:1:0:2"
msgid "A mass of enormous corrupted crystals has been detected near the Scream Puff. Pilot a vacuum suit, destroy the crystals, and gather the remnants for processing and repurposing."
msgstr "Возле «Вопля Пых» обнаружено скопление огромных искажённых кристаллов. Пилотируйте вакуумный экзокостюм, разрушьте кристаллы и соберите обломки для переработки и повторного использования."

#. ja: パワーローダーの装備を駆使し、<br>巨大偏属性クリスタルを破砕せよ。
#. de: Nutze die Funktionen deines Sternenläufers, um die Riesenkristalle zu zersplittern.
#. fr: Détruisez les grands cristaux corrompus grâce à l'armement du mécano cosmique.
#. column 1: Directive: Destroy Corrupted Crystals
#. column 2: A mass of enormous corrupted crystals has been detected near the Scream Puff. Pilot a vacuum suit, destroy the crystals, and gather the remnants for processing and repurposing.
#. column 6: Destroy small corrupted crystals and submit the remnants to the field scanners.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Destroy Corrupted Crystals” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:1:0:3"
msgid "Destroy large corrupted crystals."
msgstr "Разрушьте крупные искажённые кристаллы."

#. ja: コスモドリルで小型の偏属性クリスタルを破砕せよ。<br>獲得した資源は、フィールドサーチャーで分析にかけろ。
#. de: Zersplittere mithilfe des Kosmobohrers korrumpierte Kristalle und bringe die Splitter zum Feldsucher zur Analyse.
#. fr: Servez-vous de la cosmoforeuse pour briser les cristaux de petite taille et obtenir des échan<shy>til<shy>lons, puis apportez ces derniers à l'un des analyseurs de terrain.
#. column 1: Directive: Destroy Corrupted Crystals
#. column 2: A mass of enormous corrupted crystals has been detected near the Scream Puff. Pilot a vacuum suit, destroy the crystals, and gather the remnants for processing and repurposing.
#. column 3: Destroy large corrupted crystals.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Destroy Corrupted Crystals” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:1:0:6"
msgid "Destroy small corrupted crystals and submit the remnants to the field scanners."
msgstr "Разрушьте мелкие искажённые кристаллы и доставьте обломки полевым сканерам."

#. ja: メカオペレーション「巨大偏属性クリスタル破壊指令」が発令されました。<br>パイロット希望者は、エクスプローラータブレットから搭乗を申請してください。
#. de: Einsatzbefehl „Korrumpierte Riesenkristalle zersplittern“ ausgerufen.<br>An alle Piloten: Einsteigeerlaubnis via Exotablet beantragen.
#. fr: Un appel pour une in<shy>ter<shy>ven<shy>tion mécanique vient d'être lancé !<br>Les volontaires peuvent postuler au pilotage depuis leur tablette.
#. column 1: Directive: Destroy Corrupted Crystals
#. column 2: A mass of enormous corrupted crystals has been detected near the Scream Puff. Pilot a vacuum suit, destroy the crystals, and gather the remnants for processing and repurposing.
#. column 3: Destroy large corrupted crystals.
#. column 6: Destroy small corrupted crystals and submit the remnants to the field scanners.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:1:0:9"
msgid "The mech op directive “Destroy Corrupted Crystals” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets."
msgstr "Отдан приказ на проведение мехаоперации «Разрушение искажённых кристаллов».<br>Желающие стать пилотами, подайте заявку на управление мехом через планшет исследователя."

#. ja: まもなく、メカオペレーションが開始されます。<br>サポーター参加希望者は、任務地点にお集まりください。
#. de: Mecha-Einsatz beginnt in Kürze.<br>Bodenunterstützung bitte unverzüglich zum Einsatzort.
#. fr: L'in<shy>ter<shy>ven<shy>tion mécanique va bientôt débuter.<br>Les assistants sont priés de se rassembler dans la zone d'in<shy>ter<shy>ven<shy>tion.
#. column 1: Directive: Destroy Corrupted Crystals
#. column 2: A mass of enormous corrupted crystals has been detected near the Scream Puff. Pilot a vacuum suit, destroy the crystals, and gather the remnants for processing and repurposing.
#. column 3: Destroy large corrupted crystals.
#. column 6: Destroy small corrupted crystals and submit the remnants to the field scanners.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Destroy Corrupted Crystals” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:1:0:10"
msgid "Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location."
msgstr "Мехи скоро будут развёрнуты. Вспомогательному персоналу просьба прибыть к месту выполнения приказа."

#. ja: 有害菌床駆除指令
#. de: Befehl: Schädliche Fungi terminieren
#. fr: Nettoyage : champignons pas mignons
#. column 2: A bed of toxic spongoi has sprouted near the Mush-room. Needless to say, the proliferation of these spongoi and their spores would greatly impede the exploration initiative. Pilot a warp loader and clear out the red spongoi.
#. column 3: Clear out the toxic spongoi.
#. column 6: Clear away smaller spongoi using flamethrowers, and submit their ashes to nearby field scanners.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Clear Toxic Lunar Spongoi” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:5:0:1"
msgid "Directive: Clear Toxic Lunar Spongoi"
msgstr "Приказ: очистить Луну от токсичных грибов"

#. ja: マッシュルーム・ルーム付近で、有害な異常胞子を放つミケナ・クロロフォス菌床が大量発生した事が確認された。基地内や星外搬出機材に胞子が付着した場合、今後の探索に大きな影響をもたらす可能性がある。ホイールローダーで現地に赴き、赤きミケナ・クロロフォスを残らず駆除して繁殖を抑えてもらいたい。
#. de: In der Nähe der Pilzstube konnte ein gewaltiges Aufkommen sporenausstoßender Chlorophos-Fungi gesichtet werden. Erkorene Projektmitglieder haben sich unverzüglich um die rasche Eliminierung der Fungi zu kümmern.
#. fr: Une prolifération de <i>mycena chlorophos</i> a été constatée aux abords de la Champignonnière. Si leurs spores venaient à se répandre sur nos équipements, ce serait une catastrophe. Prenez les commandes d'une déblayeuse cosmique et éradiquez jusqu'au dernier ces vils champignons.
#. column 1: Directive: Clear Toxic Lunar Spongoi
#. column 3: Clear out the toxic spongoi.
#. column 6: Clear away smaller spongoi using flamethrowers, and submit their ashes to nearby field scanners.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Clear Toxic Lunar Spongoi” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:5:0:2"
msgid "A bed of toxic spongoi has sprouted near the Mush-room. Needless to say, the proliferation of these spongoi and their spores would greatly impede the exploration initiative. Pilot a warp loader and clear out the red spongoi."
msgstr "Возле «Грибной комнаты» выросли целые поля ядовитых грибов. Их распространение и споры серьёзно помешают исследовательской экспедиции. Садитесь за штурвал колёсного погрузчика и уничтожьте красные грибы."

#. ja: ホイールローダーの装備を駆使し、<br>巨大な異常菌床を駆除せよ。
#. de: Nutze die Funktionen deines Sternenebners, um die Chlorophos-Fungi zu eliminieren.
#. fr: Éliminez les grosses excroissances fongiques grâce à l'armement de la déblayeuse cosmique.
#. column 1: Directive: Clear Toxic Lunar Spongoi
#. column 2: A bed of toxic spongoi has sprouted near the Mush-room. Needless to say, the proliferation of these spongoi and their spores would greatly impede the exploration initiative. Pilot a warp loader and clear out the red spongoi.
#. column 6: Clear away smaller spongoi using flamethrowers, and submit their ashes to nearby field scanners.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Clear Toxic Lunar Spongoi” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:5:0:3"
msgid "Clear out the toxic spongoi."
msgstr "Уничтожьте ядовитые грибы."

#. ja: コスモフレイムスロアーで、小さな異常菌床を焼却せよ。<br>焼却後に得られた灰は、フィールドサーチャーに納品し、<br>分析にかけろ。
#. de: Verbrenne mithilfe des Kosmobrenners die kleinen Fungi und bring ihre Asche zum Feldsucher zur Analyse.
#. fr: Servez-vous du cosmolance-flammes pour brûler les petites excroissances fongiques, puis ramassez leurs cendres et apportez-les à l'un des analyseurs de terrain.
#. column 1: Directive: Clear Toxic Lunar Spongoi
#. column 2: A bed of toxic spongoi has sprouted near the Mush-room. Needless to say, the proliferation of these spongoi and their spores would greatly impede the exploration initiative. Pilot a warp loader and clear out the red spongoi.
#. column 3: Clear out the toxic spongoi.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Clear Toxic Lunar Spongoi” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:5:0:6"
msgid "Clear away smaller spongoi using flamethrowers, and submit their ashes to nearby field scanners."
msgstr "Выжгите мелкие грибы огнемётами, а пепел доставьте ближайшим полевым сканерам."

#. ja: メカオペレーション「有害菌床駆除指令」が発令されました。<br>パイロット希望者は、エクスプローラータブレットから搭乗を申請してください。
#. de: Einsatzbefehl „Schädliche Fungi terminieren“ ausgerufen.<br>An alle Piloten: Einsteigeerlaubnis via Exotablet beantragen.
#. fr: Un appel pour une in<shy>ter<shy>ven<shy>tion mécanique vient d'être lancé !<br>Les volontaires peuvent postuler au pilotage depuis leur tablette.
