#. column 2: A bed of toxic spongoi has sprouted near the Mush-room. Needless to say, the proliferation of these spongoi and their spores would greatly impede the exploration initiative. Pilot a warp loader and clear out the red spongoi.
#. column 3: Clear out the toxic spongoi.
#. column 6: Clear away smaller spongoi using flamethrowers, and submit their ashes to nearby field scanners.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
