msgstr "Мехи скоро будут развёрнуты. Вспомогательному персоналу просьба прибыть к месту выполнения приказа."

#. ja: パエンナイト掘採指令
#. de: Befehl: Phaennit abbauen
#. fr: Excavation : à la poursuite de la phaennite
#. column 2: The Saltpeter Shore is rich in phainite, a resource highly valued by the initiative. Pilot a vacuum suit, harness the necessary energy, and extract this volcanic glass from pits of quicksand.
#. column 3: Mine phainite from quicksand pits.<br>Ten units of ionic energy must be harnessed for extraction.
#. column 6: Drill for shallow reserves of phainite, and submit samples to nearby field scanners.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Mine Phainite” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:6:0:1"
msgid "Directive: Mine Phainite"
msgstr "Приказ: добыть фаэннит"

#. ja: 硝礫の川浜の地下にて、急速冷却され変質した火山ガラスの鉱床が発見されている。この有用な資源を我々は「パエンナイト」と命名、パワーローダーによる掘採計画を決定した。地下資源の獲得には多大な雷気イオンエネルギーを要するため、その大量発生時が掘採の好機だ。機体に増設したパワーゲイナーで必要なエネルギーを補給しつつ、任務に当たってくれ。
#. de: Im Boden der Glassteinküste wurden Ablagerungen von „Phaennit“ entdeckt. Dieses abgekühlte Vulkanglas ist für uns äußerst wünschenswert, weshalb wir es mithilfe der Sternenläufer bergen werden. Die dafür benötigte Energie lässt sich zu bestimmten Zeiten aus der Umgebung einsaugen.
#. fr: Des dépôts souterrains de verre ont été découverts sous les berges de Salpêtre. Extraire ces blocs de <i>phaennite</i> va demander énormément d'énergie. Rechargez votre machine au préalable à l'aide de son électroaspirateur.
#. column 1: Directive: Mine Phainite
#. column 3: Mine phainite from quicksand pits.<br>Ten units of ionic energy must be harnessed for extraction.
#. column 6: Drill for shallow reserves of phainite, and submit samples to nearby field scanners.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Mine Phainite” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:6:0:2"
msgid "The Saltpeter Shore is rich in phainite, a resource highly valued by the initiative. Pilot a vacuum suit, harness the necessary energy, and extract this volcanic glass from pits of quicksand."
msgstr "В недрах Берега селитры обнаружены богатые залежи фаэннита — ценного для исследовательской экспедиции ресурса. Пилотируйте вакуумный экзокостюм, запаситесь энергией и добывайте это вулканическое стекло из зыбучих песков."

#. ja: 流砂の穴にトーウィングビームを使用し、<br>地下のパエンナイトを回収せよ。<br>トーウィングビームは、雷気イオンパワー10を<br>消費することで使用可能。
#. de: Verwende den Schleppstrahl, um Phaennit aus den Treibsandgruben zu bergen.<br>Es werden 10 Ladungen Ionenenergie benötigt, um den Schleppstrahl einzusetzen.
#. fr: Emmagasinez 10 charges ioniques à l'aide de l'électroaspirateur, puis utilisez le rayon extracteur pour extraire les blocs de phaennite.
#. column 1: Directive: Mine Phainite
#. column 2: The Saltpeter Shore is rich in phainite, a resource highly valued by the initiative. Pilot a vacuum suit, harness the necessary energy, and extract this volcanic glass from pits of quicksand.
#. column 6: Drill for shallow reserves of phainite, and submit samples to nearby field scanners.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Mine Phainite” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:6:0:3"
msgid "Mine phainite from quicksand pits.<br>Ten units of ionic energy must be harnessed for extraction."
msgstr "Добывайте фаэннит в ямах с зыбучими песками.<br>Для добычи нужно накопить 10 единиц ионной энергии."

#. ja: コスモドリルで、地中に眠るパエンナイトを掘採せよ。<br>獲得した資源は、フィールドサーチャーに納品し、<br>分析にかけろ。
#. de: Nutze den Kosmobohrer, um Phaennit freizulegen, und bringe das gesammelte Glas zu einem Feldsucher.
#. fr: Utilisez votre cosmoforeuse pour extraire des morceaux de phaennite, puis apportez-les à l'un des analyseurs de terrain.
#. column 1: Directive: Mine Phainite
#. column 2: The Saltpeter Shore is rich in phainite, a resource highly valued by the initiative. Pilot a vacuum suit, harness the necessary energy, and extract this volcanic glass from pits of quicksand.
#. column 3: Mine phainite from quicksand pits.<br>Ten units of ionic energy must be harnessed for extraction.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Mine Phainite” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:6:0:6"
msgid "Drill for shallow reserves of phainite, and submit samples to nearby field scanners."
msgstr "Бурите неглубокие залежи фаэннита, а образцы доставляйте ближайшим полевым сканерам."

#. ja: メカオペレーション「パエンナイト掘採指令」が発令されました。<br>パイロット希望者は、エクスプローラータブレットから搭乗を申請してください。
