#. ja: ガラス塊破砕回収指令
#. de: Befehl: Glaskristalle einsammeln
#. fr: Destruction : razzia sur les amas
#. column 2: Fluctuations in the Chillmark's ground temperature have enabled the proliferation of remarkably high-purity glass clusters─a vital asset for crafting lenses and machinery. Pilot the warp loader, shatter the clusters, and collect the larger fragments that remain.
#. column 3: Shatter glass clusters.
#. column 6: Salvage glass fragments, and submit them to nearby field scanners.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Shatter Glass Clusters” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:7:0:1"
msgid "Directive: Shatter Glass Clusters"
msgstr "Приказ: расколоть стеклянные глыбы"

#. ja: チルマーク洞内で地熱の変動があり、地中から良質なガラス塊が大量に出現した。サンプルを確認した研究者によれば、自然由来と思えないほど純度が高く、精密なレンズや機器の開発に用いることで今後の探索計画で重要な役割を担う可能性さえあるという。ホイールローダーで現地に赴き、ガラス塊を破砕し、回収してほしい。
#. de: Temperaturschwankungen in der Kühlnarbe haben Glaskristalle von unnatürlich hoher Reinheit an die Oberfläche befördert, die perfekt zur Herstellung von Linsen und anderen Gerätschaften geeignet sind. Also schwingt euch auf die Sternenebner und bringt so viele wie möglich zurück.
#. fr: Les fluctuations géothermiques dans La Craquelure ont entraîné l'apparition d'amas de verre. Nos chercheurs estiment que ces matériaux pourraient servir dans le développement de lentilles de qualité. Utilisez la déblayeuse cosmique pour détruire les amas et collecter des échan<shy>til<shy>lons.
#. column 1: Directive: Shatter Glass Clusters
#. column 3: Shatter glass clusters.
#. column 6: Salvage glass fragments, and submit them to nearby field scanners.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Shatter Glass Clusters” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:7:0:2"
msgid "Fluctuations in the Chillmark's ground temperature have enabled the proliferation of remarkably high-purity glass clusters─a vital asset for crafting lenses and machinery. Pilot the warp loader, shatter the clusters, and collect the larger fragments that remain."
msgstr "Из-за колебаний температуры грунта на Морозном рубце появились скопления стекла необычайной чистоты — оно пригодится для изготовления линз и механизмов. Пилотируйте колёсный погрузчик, расколите глыбы и соберите крупные осколки."

#. ja: ホイールローダーの装備を駆使し、<br>ガラス塊を破砕せよ。
#. de: Mit einem Sternenebner Glaskristalle zerkleinern.
#. fr: Détruisez les amas de verre à l'aide de la déblayeuse cosmique.
#. column 1: Directive: Shatter Glass Clusters
#. column 2: Fluctuations in the Chillmark's ground temperature have enabled the proliferation of remarkably high-purity glass clusters─a vital asset for crafting lenses and machinery. Pilot the warp loader, shatter the clusters, and collect the larger fragments that remain.
#. column 6: Salvage glass fragments, and submit them to nearby field scanners.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Shatter Glass Clusters” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:7:0:3"
msgid "Shatter glass clusters."
msgstr "Расколите стеклянные глыбы."

#. ja: コスモゲイナーで、ガラス片を吸引せよ。<br>得られた資源は、フィールドサーチャーに納品し、<br>分析にかけろ。
#. de: Mit dem Kosmosauger Glassplitter einsaugen und bei einem Feldsucher abliefern.
#. fr: Aspirez les éclats de verre à l'aide de votre cosmoaspirateur, puis apportez-les à l'un des analyseurs de terrain.
#. column 1: Directive: Shatter Glass Clusters
#. column 2: Fluctuations in the Chillmark's ground temperature have enabled the proliferation of remarkably high-purity glass clusters─a vital asset for crafting lenses and machinery. Pilot the warp loader, shatter the clusters, and collect the larger fragments that remain.
#. column 3: Shatter glass clusters.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Shatter Glass Clusters” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:7:0:6"
msgid "Salvage glass fragments, and submit them to nearby field scanners."
msgstr "Соберите осколки стекла и доставьте их ближайшим полевым сканерам."

#. ja: メカオペレーション「ガラス塊破砕回収指令」が発令されました。<br>パイロット希望者は、エクスプローラータブレットから搭乗を申請してください。
#. de: Einsatzbefehl „Glaskristalle einsammeln“ ausgerufen.<br>An alle Piloten: Einsteigeerlaubnis via Exotablet beantragen.
#. fr: Un appel pour une in<shy>ter<shy>ven<shy>tion mécanique vient d'être lancé !<br>Les volontaires peuvent postuler au pilotage depuis leur tablette.
#. column 1: Directive: Shatter Glass Clusters
#. column 2: Fluctuations in the Chillmark's ground temperature have enabled the proliferation of remarkably high-purity glass clusters─a vital asset for crafting lenses and machinery. Pilot the warp loader, shatter the clusters, and collect the larger fragments that remain.
#. column 3: Shatter glass clusters.
#. column 6: Salvage glass fragments, and submit them to nearby field scanners.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:7:0:9"
msgid "The mech op directive “Shatter Glass Clusters” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets."
msgstr "Отдан приказ на проведение мехаоперации «Расколоть стеклянные глыбы».<br>Желающие стать пилотами, подайте заявку на управление мехом через планшет исследователя."

#. ja: まもなく、メカオペレーションが開始されます。<br>サポーター参加希望者は、任務地点にお集まりください。
#. de: Mecha-Einsatz beginnt in Kürze.<br>Bodenunterstützung bitte unverzüglich zum Einsatzort.
#. fr: L'in<shy>ter<shy>ven<shy>tion mécanique va bientôt débuter.<br>Les assistants sont priés de se rassembler dans la zone d'in<shy>ter<shy>ven<shy>tion.
#. column 1: Directive: Shatter Glass Clusters
#. column 2: Fluctuations in the Chillmark's ground temperature have enabled the proliferation of remarkably high-purity glass clusters─a vital asset for crafting lenses and machinery. Pilot the warp loader, shatter the clusters, and collect the larger fragments that remain.
#. column 3: Shatter glass clusters.
#. column 6: Salvage glass fragments, and submit them to nearby field scanners.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Shatter Glass Clusters” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:7:0:10"
msgid "Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location."
msgstr "Мехи скоро будут развёрнуты. Вспомогательному персоналу просьба прибыть к месту выполнения приказа."

#. ja: 重力歪みの解消
#. de: Befehl: Gravitationsnormalisierung
#. fr: Dissipation : gravité gravissime
#. column 2: A large-scale fluctuation has manifested spherical distortions in the vicinity of the Long-lost Carrot. Left unchecked, the effects on the region could be disastrous. Pilot the repurposed warmachina provided by our Garlean associate, and dissipate these anomalies directly.
#. column 3: Dissipate the gravitational distortions.<br>Nova grenades are effective against the larger gravity spheres.
#. column 4: Dissipate the massive gravity sphere.
#. column 6: Dissipate the subterranean gravity spheres.
#. column 7: Dissipate the massive gravity sphere.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Dissipate Distortions” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:8:0:1"
msgid "Directive: Dissipate Distortions"
msgstr "Приказ: рассеять искажения"

#. ja: ロングロスト・キャロット周辺で、大規模な重力場の歪みが観測された。大小のグラビデ系魔法の塊のようなものが出現し、放置すれば、周辺の探索区域への多大な影響が懸念される。本事象に備え、ガレアン系の技術者の協力を得て、状況の解決に特化した魔導重機を用意した。これに搭乗し、現地の重力歪みを解消してほしい。
#. de: In der Nähe der Längstverlorenen Karotte wurde eine schwerwiegende Verzerrung des Gravitationsfeldes gemessen. Zudem wurden eine Vielzahl kleinerer Gravisphären vor Ort gesichtet. Erkorene Projektmitglieder haben sich umgehend um die Normalisierung der Gravitation zu kümmern.
#. fr: Des anomalies gravitationnelles d'importance ont été mesurées près de la Carotte oubliée, et les amas sphériques issus de sorts de gravité qui sont apparus menacent d'entraver les recherches dans les environs. Prenez les commandes d'un véhicule lourd magitek et mettez fin à cette situation préoccupante.
#. column 1: Directive: Dissipate Distortions
#. column 3: Dissipate the gravitational distortions.<br>Nova grenades are effective against the larger gravity spheres.
#. column 4: Dissipate the massive gravity sphere.
#. column 6: Dissipate the subterranean gravity spheres.
#. column 7: Dissipate the massive gravity sphere.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Dissipate Distortions” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:8:0:2"
msgid "A large-scale fluctuation has manifested spherical distortions in the vicinity of the Long-lost Carrot. Left unchecked, the effects on the region could be disastrous. Pilot the repurposed warmachina provided by our Garlean associate, and dissipate these anomalies directly."
msgstr "Возле Давно потерянной моркови возникли масштабные гравитационные искажения, породившие сферические аномалии. Если их не устранить, последствия для региона могут быть катастрофическими. Пилотируйте переоборудованную боевую машину, предоставленную нашим гарлеанским союзником, и устраните аномалии."

#. ja: 魔導重機の装備を駆使し、重力の歪みを解消せよ。<br>中グラビデ塊に対しては、コスモグレネーダーが有効だ。
#. de: Nutze die Funktionen der umgebauten Panzerwaffe, um die Schwerkraft wieder zu normalisieren.<br>Gegen große Gravikugeln helfen Kosmogranaten.
#. fr: Servez-vous du véhicule magitek lourd pour rétablir l'équilibre gravitationnel.<br>Cosmogrenadage est efficace contre les grandes sphères-Gravité.
#. column 1: Directive: Dissipate Distortions
#. column 2: A large-scale fluctuation has manifested spherical distortions in the vicinity of the Long-lost Carrot. Left unchecked, the effects on the region could be disastrous. Pilot the repurposed warmachina provided by our Garlean associate, and dissipate these anomalies directly.
#. column 4: Dissipate the massive gravity sphere.
#. column 6: Dissipate the subterranean gravity spheres.
#. column 7: Dissipate the massive gravity sphere.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Dissipate Distortions” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:8:0:3"
msgid "Dissipate the gravitational distortions.<br>Nova grenades are effective against the larger gravity spheres."
msgstr "Устраните гравитационные искажения.<br>Против крупных гравитационных сфер эффективны нова-гранаты."

#. ja: 魔導重機の装備を駆使し、巨大グラビデ塊を消滅させろ。
#. de: Mit einer Kosmo-Panzerwaffe die Riesen-Gravikugel vernichten.
#. fr: Servez-vous du véhicule magitek lourd pour dissiper la sphère-Gravité géante.
#. column 1: Directive: Dissipate Distortions
#. column 2: A large-scale fluctuation has manifested spherical distortions in the vicinity of the Long-lost Carrot. Left unchecked, the effects on the region could be disastrous. Pilot the repurposed warmachina provided by our Garlean associate, and dissipate these anomalies directly.
#. column 3: Dissipate the gravitational distortions.<br>Nova grenades are effective against the larger gravity spheres.
#. column 6: Dissipate the subterranean gravity spheres.
#. column 7: Dissipate the massive gravity sphere.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Dissipate Distortions” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:8:0:4"
msgid "Dissipate the massive gravity sphere."
msgstr "Рассеять огромную гравитационную сферу."

#. ja: コスモランマーを使って、地中グラビデ塊を消滅させろ。
#. de: Mit dem Kosmostampfer innerirdische Gravikugeln vernichten.
#. fr: Utilisez votre cosmomarteau-piqueur pour dissiper les sphères-Gravité souterraines.
#. column 1: Directive: Dissipate Distortions
#. column 2: A large-scale fluctuation has manifested spherical distortions in the vicinity of the Long-lost Carrot. Left unchecked, the effects on the region could be disastrous. Pilot the repurposed warmachina provided by our Garlean associate, and dissipate these anomalies directly.
