#. column 4: Dissipate the massive gravity sphere.
#. column 7: Dissipate the massive gravity sphere.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Dissipate Distortions” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:8:0:6"
msgid "Dissipate the subterranean gravity spheres."
msgstr "Рассеять подземные гравитационные сферы."

#. ja: コスモランマーを使って、巨大グラビデ塊を消滅させろ。
