#. ja: レビテトストーンの収集
#. de: Befehl: Schwebesteine einsammeln
#. fr: Récolte : lévitation lapidaire
#. column 2: A gravitational anomaly at Cape Geras has caused the floatstones in the area to break free of the ground and hover in midair. These energized rocks are an invaluable resource for specialized study, and current conditions offer the opportunity to gather them in mass quantities.
#. column 3: Collect floatstones.
#. column 6: Collect small floatstones, and submit them to nearby field scanners.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Collect Floatstone” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:9:0:1"
msgid "Directive: Collect Floatstone"
msgstr "Приказ: собрать парящие камни"

#. ja: ケープ・ゲーラス付近で、局所的な重力異常を確認した。この影響で、地中にあったレビテトストーンが露出し、上空に浮かび上がる現象が起きている。浮かんだレビテトストーンは高密度のエネルギーを帯びており、この状態での収集ができれば、研究の大きな助けとなる。重力異常が収まる前に、収集を依頼したい。
#. de: Am Kap Geras wurde eine Gravitationsanomalie verzeichnet, die innerirdische Schwebesteine an die Oberfläche befördert hat, welche unsere Forschung gewaltig nach vorne katapultieren könnten. Erkorene Projektmitglieder haben sich umgehend um das Einsammeln zu kümmern.
#. fr: Nous avons constaté des anomalies gravitationnelles localisées dans les environs du cap Géras. Les pierres qui sont sorties de terre et lévitent depuis sont imprégnées d'une intense énergie qui serait précieuse pour nos recherches. Montez dans un mécano cosmique et allez en récolter.
#. column 1: Directive: Collect Floatstone
#. column 3: Collect floatstones.
#. column 6: Collect small floatstones, and submit them to nearby field scanners.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Collect Floatstone” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:9:0:2"
msgid "A gravitational anomaly at Cape Geras has caused the floatstones in the area to break free of the ground and hover in midair. These energized rocks are an invaluable resource for specialized study, and current conditions offer the opportunity to gather them in mass quantities."
msgstr "Гравитационная аномалия на Мысе Герас подняла из земли парящие камни. Эти наэлектризованные породы бесценны для специальных исследований, а нынешние условия позволяют собрать их в больших количествах."

#. ja: 局地用パワーローダーの装備を駆使し、<br>浮かび上がったレビテトストーンを収集せよ。
#. de: Nutze die Funktionen des Sternenläufers, um die Schwebesteine einzusammeln.
#. fr: Servez-vous du mécano cosmique localisé pour récolter des pierres-Lévitation.
#. column 1: Directive: Collect Floatstone
#. column 2: A gravitational anomaly at Cape Geras has caused the floatstones in the area to break free of the ground and hover in midair. These energized rocks are an invaluable resource for specialized study, and current conditions offer the opportunity to gather them in mass quantities.
#. column 6: Collect small floatstones, and submit them to nearby field scanners.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Collect Floatstone” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:9:0:3"
msgid "Collect floatstones."
msgstr "Соберите парящие камни."

#. ja: コスモゲイナー改で、<br>浮かび上がった小レビテトストーンを収集せよ。<br>獲得した資源は、フィールドサーチャーに納品し、<br>分析にかけろ。
#. de: Sammele mithilfe des Kosmosaugers Mk-II die kleineren Schwebesteine auf und bringe sie zum Feldsucher zur Analyse.
#. fr: Utilisez votre cosmoaspirateur amélioré pour récolter des petites pierres-Lévitation, puis apportez-les à l'un des analyseurs de terrain.
