#. ja: 古代植物のエーテル昇華
#. de: Befehl: Florasublimation herbeiführen
#. fr: Sublimation : toucher au sublime
#. column 2: The ancient plant species found at Blossomingway Beds was cultivated to sublimate at full maturity and scatter its aether into the surrounding environs. We have devised a custom growth formula to accelerate its stunted natural cycle and repair this vital ecological process.
#. column 3: Sublimate mercorn.
#. column 4: Sublimate mercorn.
#. column 6: Sublimate dwarf mercorn.
#. column 7: Sublimate dwarf mercorn.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Sublimate Ancient Plants” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:11:0:1"
msgid "Directive: Sublimate Ancient Plants"
msgstr "Приказ: вызвать эфирную сублимацию древних растений"

#. ja: ブロッサミングウェイの百花壇に分布する鱗状の古代植物は、成長後に「昇華」と呼ばれる現象を起こし、含有するエーテルを周囲に拡散する特性を持つ。これが周辺環境の維持に不可欠であるようだ。しかし都市環境の劣化ゆえか、還元間隔に乱れがある。土壌を維持すべく、魔導重機を使い植物群の昇華を促進したい。
#. de: In Blossomingways Beeten gibt es eine uralte Pflanzenart, welche sublimiert und so den eigenen Äther verteilt. Nach vielen Jahrtausenden fehlt es ihnen jedoch an Kraft dazu. Erkorene Projektmitglieder haben sich umgehend um die Sublimation zu kümmern.
#. fr: Au bout de leur croissance, les épis de maïs sirène du parterre de Blossomingway font l'expérience d'un phénomène appelé “sublimation”, qui les pousse à libérer l'éther qu'ils contiennent dans l'environnement. Utilisez un véhicule magitek pour accélérer ce processus.
#. column 1: Directive: Sublimate Ancient Plants
#. column 3: Sublimate mercorn.
#. column 4: Sublimate mercorn.
#. column 6: Sublimate dwarf mercorn.
#. column 7: Sublimate dwarf mercorn.
#. column 9: The mech op directive “Sublimate Ancient Plants” has been issued.<br>Pilot candidates, please apply for deployment via your exotablets.
#. column 10: Mechs will be deployed shortly. Supporting personnel, please report to the directive's designated location.
msgctxt "WKSMechaEventData:11:0:2"
msgid "The ancient plant species found at Blossomingway Beds was cultivated to sublimate at full maturity and scatter its aether into the surrounding environs. We have devised a custom growth formula to accelerate its stunted natural cycle and repair this vital ecological process."
msgstr "Древний вид растений, найденный на Клумбах Цветущего пути, выращивали так, чтобы по достижении зрелости он сублимировал и рассеивал эфир вокруг. Мы разработали специальную формулу роста, чтобы ускорить замедлившийся естественный цикл и восстановить этот важный экологический процесс."

#. ja: 魔導重機の装備を駆使し、<br>マーメイド・コーンにエナジーを与え、<br>昇華を発生させろ。
#. de: Nutze die Funktionen der umgebauten Panzerwaffe, um die Sublimation von Melusinenkorn herbeizuführen.
#. fr: Montez dans un véhicule magitek et insufflez de l'énergie dans les épis de maïs sirène pour stimuler la sublimation.
